{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DodgeKill is not your typical game. Here, there's no character to control\u2014your cursor is the one taking all the action! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist yet dynamic </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game visually simple, some geometric shapes, a few colors, and that's all. <br>But if we combine all this, we get a game with varied enemies and complex challenges! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to learn, hard to master </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it playable with only the mouse ? Absolutely!\u00a0 <br>You just need to move the cursor. But make no mistake, even if the controls are simple, the game remains no less complicated!\u00a0 <br>(Controllers and touchscreens are also compatible \ud83d\ude42) </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique gameplay playable entirely with the mouse </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various level filled with surprises, for increasingly difficult challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tough difficulty that tests your nerves and will give you great satisfaction with each victory </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive controls, accessible to all players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges available to increase the difficulty even more </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to take on the challenge ? </strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Secret Code","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3113950/816613f017b8c5f885b6d9007b016a729ca0e39b.jpg"},{"name":"The First One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3113950/c397e9d2ddc03373a476f89f637af75783feb743.jpg"},{"name":"The Winter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3113950/40aa27c131d1f131058535f3cd2b22e061bec39f.jpg"},{"name":"The Beac